Hi guys,

In order to keep this mailing list actually manageable and enjoyable
to read, I've enabled the moderation bit on all new members, so that
we can filter out the generic tech support requests. Most new
subscribers who post something appropriate for here will immediately
have their moderation bit removed. Hopefully that will keep the posts
that aren't interesting to a minimum, and so this list will remain
relevant.

